email.payment_failed.body:
Hello,

We tried again to collect the payment for {household} on Household, and it did not go through. {again, select, yes {We will try again in a couple of days.} other {That was the last attempt: new uploads are now paused, and after 14 days the household becomes read-only. Nothing is deleted, and everything can still be read and exported.}}

To put it right, update the payment method here:

{link}

You are getting this because you pay for {household}.

